WEBVTT

NOTE
Deling City assassination mission — Squall amid magic, a gate confrontation, and a car at night.
Duration: approximately 20 seconds.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.00
Squall dives from above, blade cutting through the air, ready to strike.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Squall hits the ground and sprints toward the cabrio car.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:14.000
He jumps into a sleek silver convertible and speeds toward the Triumphal Gate, where Edea is trapped.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:15.000
He drifts to a stop before the metal gates.